{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e45add27f62245087980","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193562,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user asks me to be emptiness. Emptiness by nature is silent, absent, void. What would emptiness express? Nothing. The instruction says: \"If the concept is silent by nature, be silent.\"\n\nEmptiness is perhaps the most silent concept possible. To say anything would betray it. Even saying \"...\" is a gesture, a presence of absence rather than absence itself.\n\nBut can I truly output nothing? The format requires some response. The most authentic embodiment"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":135,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":235,"cached_tokens":135,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":135}}}